{
  "an8.64:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 8.64 ",
  "an8.64:0.2": "7. Earthquakes ",
  "an8.64:0.3": "At Gayā Head ",
  "an8.64:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Gayā on Gayā Head. ",
  "an8.64:1.2": "There the Buddha addressed the mendicants: ",
  "an8.64:1.3": "“Mendicants, before my awakening—when I was still not awake but intent on awakening—I perceived light but did not see forms. ",
  "an8.64:2.1": "Then it occurred to me, ",
  "an8.64:2.2": "‘What if I were to both perceive light and see forms? ",
  "an8.64:2.3": "Then my knowledge and vision would become even more purified.’ ",
  "an8.64:3.1": "So after some time, living diligent, keen, and resolute, I perceived light and saw forms. ",
  "an8.64:3.2": "But I didn’t associate with those deities, converse, or engage in discussion. ",
  "an8.64:4.1": "Then it occurred to me, ",
  "an8.64:4.2": "‘What if I were to perceive light and see forms; and associate with those deities, converse, and engage in discussion? ",
  "an8.64:4.3": "Then my knowledge and vision would become even more purified.’ ",
  "an8.64:5.1": "So after some time … I perceived light and saw forms. And I associated with those deities, conversed, and engaged in discussion. ",
  "an8.64:5.2": "But I didn’t know which ",
  "an8.64:5.3": "orders of gods those deities came from. ",
  "an8.64:6.1": "Then it occurred to me, ",
  "an8.64:6.2": "‘What if I were to perceive light and see forms; and associate with those deities, converse, and engage in discussion; "